    <h1>Wylie Water Heater Companies, Ranked for 2026</h1>
    <p class="rv-lead">Wylie's water comes by way of the North Texas Municipal Water District, drawing primarily off Lavon Lake, and it tests around 225 parts per million, which puts it solidly in the "very hard" range. That mineral load builds scale inside a tank faster than it does in softer-water parts of the country, which shortens the working life of a standard water heater and makes routine flushing worth doing here more than most places. Of the five companies below, our top pick is Water Heaters For Less, a Wylie-based specialist with a street address on West FM 544 that works in water heater installation and repair rather than general plumbing. Blue Star Plumbing LLC and Rhead Plumbing LLC are also headquartered in Wylie with water heater service as part of a broader plumbing scope.</p>
