    <h2>What water heater replacement runs in Wylie</h2>
    <p>With Wylie's water testing around 225 ppm hardness, a standard tank unit without a softener ahead of it tends to scale up faster than average, which shortens its working life and is worth factoring into a repair-versus-replace decision. Tankless conversions run more, especially in tighter utility closets common in newer Inspiration and Woodbridge construction, since they often need new venting and gas-line upsizing.</p>
